{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6dff6b66-5b09-8272-b93c-7920befdc7a9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T12:49:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:43:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yes. My name is Sofia Medeiros. I'm calling about the plowing on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Medeiros. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Van Zandt Avenue. I'm at 403 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "403 Van Zandt. Got it. And what's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It hasn't been plowed. We got a dusting over the weekend and it has been so cold that it just sits there and freezes. [pause] It's packed down now. I can't get my car out of the driveway without sliding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:44:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's no good. A dusting, and it's frozen on there from the cold. Has anybody come down the street at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Nobody. [line breaks up] ...because it's a dead end. It's always the last street they do. Every time. The dead end gets plowed last."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up a little there. You said it's a dead end and it gets done last?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Dead end. Always last. Every time there is snow, we wait. This is not the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hear you. Let me make sure I have this right. 403 Van Zandt Avenue, dead-end street, light snow from the weekend, now frozen and packed, and no plow has come through. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is it the whole street that's untouched, or just the end near you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole street. I looked all the way to the corner. [inaudible] ...just tire tracks from the neighbors in the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put that down, the whole street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:45:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When will it be cleared? That is what I want to know. When."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:02-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the big question. I don't have an exact time for your street in front of me. What I can do is log this as a complaint with the location and get it over to the crew supervisor so they know it hasn't been touched. With a dusting, the crews prioritize the main roads first, and then the side streets and dead ends come after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is what they always say. Last. We pay the same taxes as everybody else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do, and I understand. I'm not going to tell you it's wrong to be annoyed about it. Let me get the report in. Can I have a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hold on. My stepdaughter is helping me look up the number for this department, she is here with me. She found it on her phone. I am on her phone's speaker, or, no, it is my phone. [crosstalk] She says say the number slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. Whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one. Five five five. Zero one eight five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me read that back. Four oh one, five five five, zero one eight five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And is there anything else about the street I should note? Is anyone there having trouble getting out, like for medical appointments, or is it just the driveways?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the driveways and the street. The ice is the problem. I do not want to fall. I have to go to the store and I do not want to drive on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll add that the packed ice is making it hard to get out and that people are concerned about safety. Do you have sand or salt at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little. Not much. I put some on the steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good for the steps at least. So I have the report as, 403 Van Zandt Avenue, whole dead-end street unplowed since the weekend snow, packed and frozen, and you'd like to know when the crew will get there. I'll send it to the supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will someone call me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:58-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll ask them to. I can't promise you'll hear from someone this afternoon, but it'll have your number on it. If the plow comes through before then, great. If it doesn't by tomorrow morning, call us again and mention this report, and we'll follow up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow morning. Okay. I will call if nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds right. And I'm sorry about the wait, Ms. Medeiros. I know a dead end feels forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. Okay. Thank you for taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay warm, and be careful on that ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
